{"2787860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mythical Whalers", "steam_appid": 2787860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4893590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/extras/cf2cd3652fe0e6a3b4ee109971971fd5.poster.avif?t=1788150954\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/extras/cf2cd3652fe0e6a3b4ee109971971fd5.webm?t=1788150954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your crew and set sail across a perilous, procedurally generated world. Traverse eight distinct biomes teeming with bizarre creatures and factions locked in a desperate struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt deadly sea beasts for precious resources and barter with nearby factions for vital equipment and supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your crew as they evolve, their traits shifting for better or worse as the voyage unfolds. Seek out and recruit new members from the mythical races dwelling upon the myriad islands you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your crew with potent elixirs brewed from the coveted gem horns of the whales they slay, bestowing them with formidable abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/extras/8d59140365072fd236e3db628faae22a.avif?t=1788150954\" width=588 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge alliances or wage war with the crews of rival factions. But heed this warning: your choices are remembered, and every decision bears a consequence.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/extras/297206a7b51892947f9adbee09575cbd.avif?t=1788150954\" width=588 height=364 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/extras/cf2cd3652fe0e6a3b4ee109971971fd5.poster.avif?t=1788150954\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/extras/cf2cd3652fe0e6a3b4ee109971971fd5.webm?t=1788150954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your crew and set sail across a perilous, procedurally generated world. Traverse eight distinct biomes teeming with bizarre creatures and factions locked in a desperate struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt deadly sea beasts for precious resources and barter with nearby factions for vital equipment and supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your crew as they evolve, their traits shifting for better or worse as the voyage unfolds. Seek out and recruit new members from the mythical races dwelling upon the myriad islands you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your crew with potent elixirs brewed from the coveted gem horns of the whales they slay, bestowing them with formidable abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/extras/8d59140365072fd236e3db628faae22a.avif?t=1788150954\" width=588 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge alliances or wage war with the crews of rival factions. But heed this warning: your choices are remembered, and every decision bears a consequence.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/extras/297206a7b51892947f9adbee09575cbd.avif?t=1788150954\" width=588 height=364 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Set sail in the shrouded seas. A procedurally generated world where each voyage is unique. Captain a crew of mythical races to face monstrous leviathans and gain status with cunning factions. Every decision bears a consequence, forge your legacy or be lost to the depths!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/header.jpg?t=1788150954", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788150954", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788150954", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Open GL 3.2+ Compliant<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Recommend 16:9 Aspect ratio</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_re